  "bodyHash": "ByhDdM+8/vc=",
  "content": "<h3>FTB Ultimine <em>(Fabric版)</em></h3><p>FTB Ultimine 提供了高效模式，可同时采集多个方块。只需在Minecraft控制界面中设置好指定按键并按住即可激活模组，采集到的物品会直接掉落在你的脚下，无需四处走动！在1.15及以上版本中，该模组通过在被挖掘方块周围渲染白色线条来提升可视性，不仅清晰指示了挖矿区域，外观也十分炫酷！</p><p>更多关于FTB Ultimine的信息，请访问我们的文档站点 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdocs-ultimine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/docs-ultimine</a></p><h4><strong>支持与依赖</strong></h4><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com//assets/a1/mods/supports-fabric@smallest.webp\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/requires-arch@smallest.webp?v=1\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><strong>搭配使用</strong></h4><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-chunks-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/pairs-with-chunks@smallest.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-essentials-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/a1/mods/pairs-with-essentials@smallest.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p><h4><strong>主要功能</strong></h4><ul>\n<li><strong>高效方块采集</strong>：按住可配置的波浪线/反引号键，同时采集多个方块，简化挖矿流程。</li>\n<li><strong>增强视觉效果（1.15+）</strong>：在被挖掘、收割或锄地的方块周围显示白色线条，提供清晰的操作提示，减少误操作！</li>\n<li><strong>锄头用于草方块</strong>：类似地使用锄头处理草方块，可同时耕作多个方块，节省时间和精力。</li>\n<li><strong>作物收割</strong>：右键点击作物即可简化收割过程，轻松收集资源。</li>\n<li><strong>特殊草方块处理</strong>：对草方块进行特殊处理，有效管理超出标准1格范围的类草方块。</li>\n<li><strong>挖掘辅助</strong>：使用Ultimine还能轻松挖掘隧道，无论是向上还是向下的楼梯，都能直达下一个矿道！</li>\n</ul><p>FTB Ultimine 旨在优化你的挖矿和农耕活动，提供流畅高效的游戏体验。它已包含在我们的许多整合包及其他作品中！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/OCYVCUi.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/OY1v6uo.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>你也可以用类似的方式用锄头处理草方块，一次耕作多个方块：</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/rB22fHN.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>以及通过右键点击收割作物：</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/vMBREKF.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>草方块具有特殊处理，会检测1格范围外的方块：</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/mods/ftb-ultimine/w3Pad8m.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>支持</h2><ul>\n<li>对于<strong>整合包</strong>问题，请访问：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-modpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-modpack</a></li>\n<li>对于<strong>模组</strong>问题，请访问：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fsupport-mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/support-mod-issues</a></li>\n<li>有疑问？加入我们的Discord：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://go.ftb.team/discord</a></li>\n</ul><hr><h2>保持关注</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fgithub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-github.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitter-x.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252fyoutube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-youtube.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftwitch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-twitch.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252finstagram\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-instagram.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ffacebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-facebook.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgo.ftb.team%252ftiktok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.feed-the-beast.com/assets/socials/icons/social-tiktok.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
